1
00:00:00,569 --> 00:00:03,399
(Amy:)Who says this is
the only one I hid?

2
00:00:13,747 --> 00:00:15,917
(Leonard:)Hello? What is this?

3
00:00:15,917 --> 00:00:18,517
We built a fort!

4
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,750
(Leonard:)Are those my sheets?

5
00:00:20,755 --> 00:00:23,125
(Amy:)Yes, they are.

6
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:24,395
(Wil:)Okay.

7
00:00:24,392 --> 00:00:26,222
(Leonard:)Well, you kids have fun.

8
00:00:26,228 --> 00:00:27,398
(Leonard:)I'm gonna go to sleep.

9
00:00:27,395 --> 00:00:30,195
(Sheldon:)Leonard, don't you want to see
the inside of the fort?

10
00:00:30,198 --> 00:00:31,398
(Leonard:)Yeah, I'm good.

11
00:00:31,399 --> 00:00:32,899
(Sheldon:)Oh, come on.

12
00:00:32,901 --> 00:00:35,101
(Sheldon:)I really wanted to tell someone
they can't come in.

13
00:00:35,103 --> 00:00:36,773
(Leonard:)Okay, fine.

14
00:00:36,771 --> 00:00:39,911
(Leonard:)Sheldon, may I please
visit your fort?

15
00:00:39,908 --> 00:00:41,578
(Sheldon:)I want to say no,

16
00:00:41,576 --> 00:00:43,146
(Sheldon:)but it's too glorious.
Get in here!

17
00:00:44,812 --> 00:00:47,812
(Howard:)Thank you.
Okay, have a seat on the floor.

18
00:00:47,816 --> 00:00:50,886
SHELDON:
Not there. That's my spot.

